{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rebels have developed a shrinking weapon to enforce their plans with brute force. However, their creation has turned against them. Among the Rebels hide Spies, who have shrunk everyone in a desperate attempt to sabotage the group's ambitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the Spies must await reinforcements without revealing their identities, while the Agents are on a mission to expose them and execute a series of <i>takedowns</i> to reclaim control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to Play:</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452060/extras/e2168df9b6c4f3bc17f144a475cb099b.poster.avif?t=1773528078\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452060/extras/e2168df9b6c4f3bc17f144a475cb099b.webm?t=1773528078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Takedowns is a social deduction game where you must deceive your friends or uncover their secrets! Play with 3-12 friends online and prove who is the ultimate Spy or the smartest Rebel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each round, players have time to choose between 3 unique skills or special weapons to enhance their gameplay. This ensures every match feels fresh and exciting. With a bit of luck, you might get your hands on particularly powerful skills, determined by their rarity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the preparation phase ends, roles are assigned:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebels</strong>: The majority team must work together to uncover clues, identify the Spies, and eliminate them. But beware - taking out an innocent friend will weigh heavily on your conscience and come with a significant penalty!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spies</strong>: As the underdog team, your goal is to survive, confuse, or take out the Rebels. Helping uncover clues that incriminate you might grant you unique weapons, allowing for better defense or secret sabotage to claim victory. However, if you're exposed, your location will be revealed to everyone!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer: 3-12 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique skills every round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Typical social deduction roles reversed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cat gun and other weird stuff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive hamsters:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452060/extras/5231332061e4fbf444bc7640880d0dc8.poster.avif?t=1773528078\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452060/extras/5231332061e4fbf444bc7640880d0dc8.webm?t=1773528078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What customers say:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452060/extras/1412b0f6bf2ce250e6939fe62645a76b.avif?t=1773528078\" width=128 height=128 /></span><strong>Jimmy:</strong> \u201cThis game is amazing! I love it. I haven\u2019t seen my wife or kids in four days because I\u2019m so addicted!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452060/extras/7168ad37cf8cae38c9a1ba662b106891.avif?t=1773528078\" width=128 height=128 /></span><strong>Definitely-not-a-spy Jimmy:</strong> \u201cI\u2019m not the spy!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452060/extras/51f1b74becf4f3295e402e9a47c09608.avif?t=1773528078\" width=128 height=128 /></span><strong>Hamster:</strong> <i>sad violin noises</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452060/extras/a98d4153b3c6d3e71c7acf5f4019d757.avif?t=1773528078\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452060/extras_big/a98d4153b3c6d3e71c7acf5f4019d757.avif?t=1773528078 width=800 height=459 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shrinking the world, one takedown at a time. Ready to uncover secrets, create chaos, and outplay your friends? Welcome to <i>Tiny Takedowns</i>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3452060?t=1773528078","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452060/af2bd1d18581f57dfa8dceb7d84271b12e8582e5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773528078","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452060/897f95b494ec2deffdb9f254b771c3a02b24841a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773528078","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452060/897f95b494ec2deffdb9f254b771c3a02b24841a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773528078","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":